Subject: [native] apply expanded Atom boards after the existing classic RMT

Native full-stack variant of peripheral 0088 (SHA256
23d152309b13acea3aabd5fa7e3a1c1ec3fe27a159f547467fa356caeb948bb7).
The product recipe already applied 0066. Keep its existing source, header,
SoC call and Meson entry; apply the actual 0088 RMT algorithm delta and all
new board/Unit additions. The resulting RMT C bytes exactly match 0088.
No 0071-0084 historical layers are introduced. Apply after 0085-0087.

